Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.03,0:00:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充满活力的跳跃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强有力的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂浮在空中的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应援和鼓励所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让大家都露出笑容的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像照亮世界的太阳一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 坐下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没...没事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你唯独在为晴子加油的时候嗓门特别大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 机会 好机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一本
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢了 冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你姐真厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.11,0:01:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样阿一 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爸老妈 太丢人了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 这可是命志院大学女子柔道部
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成立以来的第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.17,0:02:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大的功臣毫无疑问就是晴子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我还是我第一次不穿道服看比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一口气 主将
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快吃快吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20分钟内一粒不剩全吃光才行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.86,0:02:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主将 请加油
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:28.98,左上记,,0,0,0,,{\c&H3BC7E2&}挑战菜单 {\c&H605BCE&}争求挑战者\N {\c}20分钟内吃完\N{\c&H605BCE&}免费\N{\c}特典：\N秘密菜单\N半价证\N礼品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:29.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主将
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主将 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主将 加油吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咖喱是饮料哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坂东弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了啊 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打招呼的时候不能精神点吗 晴希
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么都上大学了还怕生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:02:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸妈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是要认真地重新制定一下今后的训练计划
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.02,0:03:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是去看望他外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 祝贺你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天太帅了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然说这个干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有你帮我加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听见你的声音了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每次都觉得阿晴的应援声里藏着一股力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.47,0:03:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴希
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 肩膀一定会好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 时间到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:52.75,上标,NTP,0,0,0,,谁借我点钱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.86,0:03:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主将引退前你得吃完一次啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给 外婆 给你削了苹果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看着真好吃 多好的外孙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,kasu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子 做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝贺你 晴子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚饭想吃什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝贺你获胜 想吃啥尽管说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.25,0:04:49.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们刚吃完 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.09,0:04:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我去洗个澡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 我也想洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 不该往下看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么 别擅自跑到别人家里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 本想借浴室洗个澡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知晴子正在洗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.53,0:06:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈妈叫你把消炎药吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 你想事的时候总来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想问你呢 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有心事的时候也总来这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得自己从小就经常来这儿躺着 和你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.15,0:06:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的外婆还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.95,0:06:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好着呢 苹果削多少吃多少 我都来不及削
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.79,0:06:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 那我下次也去看看她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说了没事 别到时候被她拖着聊天回不了家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说能拿女子冠军也太牛了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你姐到底有多强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.39,0:07:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要生在柔道家庭里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多愁善感模式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在场外帮人加油之后我才明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没法变得像姐姐那么帅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很帅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你投摔对手的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:39.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表情就好像自己被摔出去了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的柔道就帅在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一滴雨珠落在你鼻尖上了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.16,0:08:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是有个类似于都市传说的说法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是第一滴雨落在鼻尖上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿望就会实现？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.71,0:08:19.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二天就会拉出漫画里那种翔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.61,0:08:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.99,0:08:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来这里干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坂东吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 打拢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师刚才我看见阿一...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见桥本从办公室里出去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他找您有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说要退出柔道部
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说等下坂东也会来找我说同样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我听听你的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:45.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么在学校里跑那么快
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丢不丢人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...你为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 先把气喘匀了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.31,0:09:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么也要退出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.68,0:09:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本没必要放弃柔道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之你得继续练柔道 你有实力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高二的时候都参加过高中联赛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜在第二轮就输了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这样的连参赛都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直很烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道自己该不该留在命志院的柔道部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己是不是因为坂东道场儿子的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才成了体育特招生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以肩膀受伤的时候 我反而松了口气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想这下就能放弃柔道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 你没必要放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.31,0:10:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸妈死了以后 转到这里的学校
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结交的第一个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你的邀请 我才练起了柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们永远是一起的 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以退出的时候也要一起退
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说什么呢 阿一 你...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦我也是算准了时机的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柔道不练了 以及
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和你一起做一件新的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦队？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:11:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 男子啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 你也出点声
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看一看...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...我喊不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样怎么召集部员
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有部员 咱们也没法开始训练啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫咱们...我只是来帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.98,0:12:28.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦队不都只有女生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:32.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不啊 最近貌似男生也有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 再怎么说我也不干
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦队正在招收部员
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.21,0:12:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好 我们是男子啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:52.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请看一下 男子啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:57.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在召集部员请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...我要参...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 下面去十号馆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 我打算等下去食堂发传单
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都发一周了 连一个申请入部的人都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照这样下去 永远只有咱们两个人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没答应参加
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不想想其他方法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那去我家开作战会议
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么走路看着点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你说个事呗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说一到满月之夜 凌晨三点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铜像就会动 不知真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 吃棒冰吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久没来你家了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是那么破
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁啊 你朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:15:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫沟口涉 不是谁的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太闷热了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能开窗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打不开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说你谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才我应该介绍过 我叫沟口涉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我说的不是名宇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.09,0:15:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴居然吐槽一个初次见面的人 太少见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 因为这家伙实在太难沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.89,0:15:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁夸你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:58.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是商学部一年级的沟口涉 20岁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前几天收到这张传单
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时很感兴趣想问问情況来着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但错过了整整一个礼拜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错过太久了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要以为机会会敲第二次门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是法国的思想家桑弗说的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一看到传单时我就想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.68,0:16:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我想打开这扇被敲响的门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢参与新鲜的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想向没人做过的事发起挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为他人应援的你 将成为主角
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.07,0:16:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,助他人一臂之力 也会鼓舞...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说你又为什么想成立男子啦啦队呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我第一次给阿晴看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺带我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是今天刚认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的爸妈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这张照片真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的妈妈曾是啦啦队员
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在大学时加入了啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸是那里的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.75,0:17:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他俩后来结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈在高中时期邂逅了啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后一直热衷其中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实业团时代 她所在的队但甚至有资格参加世界大赛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候也听说过好多次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.94,0:17:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦队是一群应援和鼓励所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让大家都露出笑容的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想像这样高高地飞上天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像她们一样 打动别人的心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应援 然后起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天跟我去一个地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's GO SPARKS
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现场看挺有气势的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气势确实有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一般大家都觉得啦啦队员全是女生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有像SPARKS这样男女混编的队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.35,0:19:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想试试全男子的队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一定会是一支前所未有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活力四射而又愉快的崭新队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO SPARKS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:19:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...我恐...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.71,0:20:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怕 大家一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 咱们能行的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说得那么轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为想表演成那样 需要练多久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还是全男子队？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 搞笑三人组吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.23,0:20:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想玩玩的话劝你们还是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不试试怎么知道行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那阿晴 你愿意和我成立啦啦队部？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.21,0:20:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.79,0:20:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得啦啦队很适合你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总觉得阿晴的应援声里有种力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴的应援声里藏着一股力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.52,0:21:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试就试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就知道阿晴会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就第三个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.15,0:21:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凭什么我是第三个 第三个不是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.24,0:21:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到传单的时候说决定加入了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我比你早
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先咱们三个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.30,0:21:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在青春生活中 最能给人幸福的东西其本质
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.97,0:21:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是朋友的馈赠 这是奥斯罗说的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.61,0:21:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始练动作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是倒V 高V
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是推起 这些是啦啦队的基本动作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后分腿跳 分腿跳 分腿跳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.21,0:22:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也照着书练过 这动作根本不标准啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...我 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来试试
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 大家一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.09,0:22:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒V
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:16.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高V
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.22,0:22:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.26,0:22:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.85,0:22:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳舞?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.35,0:22:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:32.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(975.499,801.071)}{\c&HD59FE5&}开幕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:32.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(959.785,785.929)}{\c&HE4DB75&}开幕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:32.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(943.5,772.5)}开幕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:55.20,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结束漫不经心度过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:59.29,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}满心想要脱离现状
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:04.88,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我总是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.03,0:23:09.01,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次是你牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.11,0:23:14.76,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带我去看新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.95,0:23:17.31,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界变幻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:19.27,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:22.85,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仿佛带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.71,0:23:28.40,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再担心 我们在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:30.07,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.13,0:23:31.61,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以最本真的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:34.82,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:41.41,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有太多事情 不试试没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:43.04,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.10,0:23:47.75,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伸手仿佛能触碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.90,0:23:51.01,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不再孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.11,0:23:56.18,OP_CN_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:55.20,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:59.29,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:04.88,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.03,0:23:09.01,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.11,0:23:14.76,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.95,0:23:17.31,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:19.27,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:22.85,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.71,0:23:28.40,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:30.07,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.13,0:23:31.61,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:34.82,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:41.41,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:43.04,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.10,0:23:47.75,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.90,0:23:51.01,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.11,0:23:56.18,OP_JP_1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边那位想做些新鲜事的男生！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.84,0:24:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边那位想做些好玩的事的男生！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我们一起竭尽全力为别人应援呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.80,0:24:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.05,0:24:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 最初的应援笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
